    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he awakens from a terrible accident, Sejima Seiya finds himself in another world\u2014Laurentide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world with a legend, long held by its people:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500The seed that shall give birth to heroes and end the era of war shall come from another world.\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiya has that seed within him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And despite being viewed as breeding stock, he still wishes to have sex.<br>But now the father of the future heroes could become king of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn by the legend, beautiful women gather from across the world, seeking his seed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500Or perhaps some harbor the ambition of unifying the world under their motherland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500Or perhaps some simply desire sex with Seiya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless, Seiya's days of getting milked by beautiful women have begun...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Traditional Visual Novel with multiple heroines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 2,000 CGs and variations to explore! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ hours of average reading time  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the creator of Princess Evangile and Imouto Paradise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes bonus content: Maternity Dress Patch!</p></li></ul>",
